# All optional. If none are set, Agent 4 (outreach drafting) falls back
# to a rule-based template instead of calling an LLM -- the pipeline
# still runs and produces real output with zero setup.
#
# Set ONE of the following to upgrade Agent 4 to real LLM-drafted
# messages. If both are set, ANTHROPIC_API_KEY takes priority.

# Option 1: Claude (api.anthropic.com)
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# Option 2: literally any other LLM, as long as it exposes an
# OpenAI-compatible chat-completions endpoint -- OpenAI, Groq, Together,
# Fireworks, DeepSeek, Mistral, a local Ollama/LM Studio server, etc.
LLM_API_KEY=
# LLM_BASE_URL=https://api.openai.com/v1
# LLM_MODEL=gpt-4o-mini
